# Typed into the Go console of go-uefi-dhcp.img on q35 with its own 82574L
# (make q35-smoke's second boot, W28-S01): the hardware report (its line for
# the card), the network's state, then poweroff.
wait burrow>
type hw
key ret
wait mounts:
type net
key ret
wait inet 10.0.2.15
type poweroff
key ret
